WEBVTT

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:14.640
Not that either of you asked,

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.840
but I would highly
recommend learning Charms.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:17.800
(Newt) Lally.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:19.240
What kept you two?

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:22.120
Uh, we encountered some
complications. You?

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:25.040
We encountered some complications.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:30.800
Jacob tried to murder Grindelwald?

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:32.680
-It's a long story. -(Theseus
scoffs)

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.440
Is it really snakewood?

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:36.160
Yes, it's really snakewood.

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:38.880
-Can I... -(Jacob groans) Mm-mm.

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:40.760
Very dangerous.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:42.360
It's very powerful.

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:45.280
It's rare. If it got in the
wrong hands, you know...

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:46.360
mess you up.

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:48.000
Where did you get it?

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.600
I got it for Christmas.

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:51.720
(Lally) Jacob,

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:53.040
look who I found.

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:54.160
Hey.

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:56.520
It's my wizard friends,
Newt and Theseus.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.880
We're like this, okay, and
that's me right there.

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:01.200
I gotta go. All right, have fun.

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:03.400
Don't do anything I wouldn't do.

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:05.280
Can you believe this place?

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:06.560
They got pint-sized little
witches and wizards

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:07.600
running around here. (chuckles)

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:08.880
(Theseus) You don't say.

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:10.800
(whispers) I was the assassin.

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:13.200
Newt and Theseus both
went to Hogwarts.

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:15.240
(Jacob) Oh, I knew that. Well,
they're being very nice to me.

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:17.160
The Slytherin boys over
there, they gave me these.

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.000
They're delicious. Who wants one?

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:21.800
I never cared for cockroach
clusters much myself,

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:24.320
although Honeydukes are
supposed to be the best.

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:27.680
-(all laughing) -(bell ringing)

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:30.920
Off you go.

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:32.640
(Theseus) McGonagall.

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:34.400
Albus.

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:35.440
(Dumbledore) Well done.

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:37.080
All of you, well done.

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:38.040
Congratulations.

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:39.760
-Congratulations? -Indeed.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:42.960
Professor Hicks managed
to foil an assassination.

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:46.040
And you are alive and you are well.

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:48.880
The fact that everything
didn't go precisely to plan

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:50.200
was precisely the plan.

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:51.640
Countersight 101.

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:54.080
Albus, forgive me, but aren't
we back where we started?

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:56.840
Actually, I would argue
that things are...

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:59.000
a great deal worse.

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:02.360
You haven't told them, have you?

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:06.480
Grindelwald's been allowed
to stand in the election.

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:08.720
-What? -But how?

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:12.760
Because Vogel chose easy over
right.

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:35.360
(Jacob) Hmm.

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:37.440
It's all right.

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:39.080
Bhutan.

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:41.080
Correct. Three points to
Hufflepuff.

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:45.360
The kingdom of Bhutan sits
high in the Eastern Himalayas.

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:49.080
It's a place of indescribable
beauty.

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:52.520
Some of our most important
magic has its origins there.

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:57.360
They say if you listen carefully
enough, the past whispers to you.

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:01.040
It also happens to be where
the election will be held.

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:02.400
He can't win, can he?

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:04.760
Only a few days ago he was
a fugitive from justice.

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:07.440
Now he is an official
candidate in the

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:10.080
International
Confederation of Wizards.

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:14.760
Dangerous times favor dangerous
men.

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:20.200
By the way, we'll be dining
with my brother in the village.

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:23.040
Should you need anything
before then, Minerva is here.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:25.760
Dumbledore has a brother?

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:29.880
(Theseus) Huh.

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:33.360
(trills)

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:41.520
(purrs)

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:44.360
(Dumbledore) Here we are.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:45.800
(wind whistling)

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:47.520
(Qilin grunts)

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:50.200
Bunty, you're here.

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:51.320
Yes.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.080
How is she?

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:55.160
(Bunty) Oh, she's fine.

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:57.160
(Newt) Whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:03:57.240 --> 00:03:58.800
What's Alfie done now?

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:01.040
Wait, you've not been biting
Timothy's bottom again, have you?

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:05.440
Miss Broadacre, I trust my brother
has been a gracious host?

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.040
Yes, ever so gracious.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:09.640
I'm delighted to hear.

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:13.120
Uh, so, rooms have been
arranged for you in the village

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:16.560
and Aberforth here will prepare
you a delicious dinner,

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:18.160
his own recipe.

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:24.000
(dishes clang)

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:26.480
There's more of that if you want
it.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:31.960
Thank you.

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:33.720
Thanks.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:38.160
Astonishing.

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:41.400
Never has something that looks so
repellent tasted so delicious.

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:43.480
-(trilling) -Who is this little
one?

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:44.520
Do you mind?

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:47.040
She's a Qilin, Jacob.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.880
She's incredibly rare.

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:51.360
One of the most beloved creatures
in the Wizarding World.

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:52.800
Why?

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:55.360
'Cause she can see into your soul.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.600
Oh. Oh!

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:00.040
You're kidding me.

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:05.800
No. So, if you are good and
worthy, then she'll see that.

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:09.480
But if, on the other hand,
you're cruel and deceitful,

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:11.360
then she'll know that too.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:13.520
Oh, yeah?

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:16.080
Does she just tell you that or...
(laughs)

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:18.200
Not exactly tells.

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:20.920
Well, she bows, but
only in the presence

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.920
of someone truly pure of heart.

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:26.520
I mean, almost none
of us are, of course,

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:29.000
no matter how good of a
person one tries to be.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:33.040
There was actually a time,
many, many years ago,

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:35.440
when the Qilin chose who'd lead us.

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:38.520
(Jacob) No...

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:41.560
-(chittering) -Whoa. Woop. Whoa...

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:42.920
(Bunty laughs)

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:45.280
(chuckles) Okay. All right,
already.

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:47.640
-(trilling) -(chuckles)

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:48.920
Here you go.

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:51.080
Thriving.

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:52.640
He's just hungry. Look at him.

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:54.480
-(Bunty) She really likes you,
Jacob. -(Jacob) Oh, all right.

00:05:57.800 --> 00:05:58.760
It's okay.

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:06.720
(chatter continues softly)

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:07.840
(soft music playing)

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:09.240
(Dumbledore) Come with me.

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:12.240
I'll help you.

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.960
He's your son, Aberforth.

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:20.160
He needs you.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:30.320
(gentle knock)

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:33.920
Newt.

